@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api

### Exercise 1 — upload an image (put cat.png next to this file)
POST {{baseUrl}}/UploadImage
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cat.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./cat.png
------Boundary--

### Exercise 2 — write a person to Cosmos DB
POST {{baseUrl}}/AddPerson
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Timon",
  "lastName": "Bynens",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Exercise 2 — read a secret from Key Vault
GET {{baseUrl}}/GetSmtpServer

### Exercise 4 — get a link that expires in 2 minutes (use the fileName from the upload)
GET {{baseUrl}}/GetImageLink?name=PASTE_FILENAME_HERE
